{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1262307-help-needed-changeling-names","id":1262307,"title":"Help Needed - Changeling Names","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-23T00:07:19-07:00","id":1262307,"title":"Help Needed - Changeling Names","content":"Hey all -<br /> <br /> I'm working on a character for a C:tD game (first one I've played in around 20 years) and I'm stuck on the characters name - specifically if they use their mortal name, a fae name, or some cross between the two.<br /> <br /> I've tried to find examples and all options seem common enough, but that could just be due to previously editorial preference. How do you run/play Changeling names?<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2763-nunboi","name":"nunboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2763_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T13:12:45-07:00","id":1262396,"title":"","content":"All Kith have some kind of mythological background. So most times I try to pick a name from that background (a greek-ish sounding name for a satyr) and maybe add some sort of title for a rather accomplished individual. For example, a satyr from my current game (even though he's currently out of the game due to being an old grump by now): Ioseph the Jumper. He once smacked a bunch of Technocracy agents with his hoofs without landing on the ground for the whole fight. (I know, it's very crossover-y in my games.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T15:36:29-07:00","id":1262423,"title":"","content":"I think it usually varies a bit depending on the character's Kith, allegiance (commoner, noble, other?), and other factors. One of the &quot;straight out of Arcadia&quot; Sidhe likely would've had a completely faerie name reflecting old Irish (or Norse, Rus, or whathaveyou depending on House) conventions. A commoner Boggin might keep the name she grew up with (especially if she doesn't change until being a Grump). Others might adapt nicknames, deed names, aliases, the names of past incarnations they can remember, invocations of past heroes, and other possibilities. As an example, a wilder Redcap in east Pennsylvania might've been born Sara Donovan, but now she's Red Molly, violent revolutionary against the nobility and mortal authority.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T04:13:54-07:00","id":1262492,"title":"","content":"A Changeling can have a mortal name, a Changeling name, a nickname (good for Sidhes who have looong and boring names), a True Name determined during the Saining, and maybe a deed name, if you are Wolf-Blooded.<br /> Because your lord's pet sorcerer found out your True Name during the Saining, you are in a mess, just because your backstory.<br /> 'Cause who knows your True Name have -4 diff. from every mystical acts on you, including blessings and curses.<br /> <br /> I've got an impression that sharing your True Name with somebody is one of the greatest act of trust.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T00:15:28-07:00","id":1262634,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the replies - I'm playing an Autumn Sidhe, Scathach to be specific. In tabletop terms he's a Wilder (the new LARP rules are very different when it comes to Seeming).<br /> <br /> I'm guessing based on the feedback it's probably best to go with a combo of birth name and a monicker.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2763-nunboi","name":"nunboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2763_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T10:33:55-07:00","id":1262692,"title":"","content":"One might also consider incorporating a modernish story they want people to connect them to. Certain super heroes just scream Scathach aspects and Changelings are going to give you much less shit if you call yourself Bruce Wayhe than say a vampire would.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T23:53:48-07:00","id":1262802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1262307-help-needed-changeling-names?p=1262692#post1262692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One might also consider incorporating a modernish story they want people to connect them to. Certain super heroes just scream Scathach aspects and Changelings are going to give you much less shit if you call yourself Bruce Wayhe than say a vampire would.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was actually thinking something more pro-wrestler-ish in terms of structure, Bret &quot;the Hitman&quot; Hart, &quot;Stone Cold&quot; Steve Austin. This Moniker plus name. This should work as the character as he has a mortal name and handle that could easily scale to be themed to be Fae-esque but not being to superhero or too baroque.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2763-nunboi","name":"nunboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2763_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-28T16:28:07-07:00","id":1263281,"title":"","content":"Come up with a human name and a fae name. Whatever name you use will sort itself out through play. Chances are the other players will decide what your name actually is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}